 "description": "Twin Streams: two rocky plateaus split a wide green valley, each with a small stream cutting through. The left plateau has a stream at its base; the right plateau is split by a river that flows off the NE edge. The 5 ramps (2 on each main plateau, 1 on the small NE outcrop) are the only legal ascent to the high ground. The base level is rolling green grassland with marshy pockets in the low ground; the plateau level is rocky upland with shallow soil and dense tree groves. Player spawns in the NW, enemy in the SE - must either fight across the grassland between the plateaus or thread a ramp to claim the high ground.",
